        "proposed": "dart_fss.query_counterparty_disclosure",
        "rationale": "SK ecoplant is a privately-held Korean entity (failed KOSPI IPO) so its commitments do not appear in EDGAR. Layer 3 Rule 7 (counterparty-disclosure threshold) requires the counterparty to corroborate a 500 MW take-or-pay commitment \u2014 for SK ecoplant that means DART filings (either its own or its listed parent SK Inc., ticker 034730.KS). Absence of any DART reference to Bloom while Bloom counts SK ecoplant as a ~37% customer is a HARD CONTRADICTION.",
